1
00:00:33,399 --> 00:00:37,600
I held the heavy plastic to my ear,

2
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:43,399
And dialed the wheel into the silent hall.

3
00:00:44,100 --> 00:00:48,799
My world was built on logic, clean and pure,

4
00:00:49,399 --> 00:00:54,600
Where ones and zeroes never let me fall.

5
00:00:55,299 --> 00:00:59,799
And then I spoke the lie across the line,

6
00:01:00,399 --> 00:01:05,400
A fake project on mainframes in the night.

7
00:01:06,099 --> 00:01:10,799
The bitter taste of lead upon my tongue,

8
00:01:11,299 --> 00:01:16,799
My forehead pressed against the wall so white.

9
00:01:28,200 --> 00:01:32,700
Her mother left her card upon the glass,

10
00:01:33,299 --> 00:01:38,099
And trusted me to guard her fragile sleep.

11
00:01:38,799 --> 00:01:43,599
A final warning whispered in the dark,

12
00:01:44,200 --> 00:01:50,000
A sacred promise that I swore to keep.

13
00:01:50,500 --> 00:01:55,099
I traded in my innocence for you,

14
00:01:55,599 --> 00:02:00,599
I broke the golden rule I held so dear.

15
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:06,000
I lied to my own mother on the phone,

16
00:02:06,500 --> 00:02:12,500
To keep you safe and hold you through the fear.

17
00:02:44,500 --> 00:02:49,599
I slid beneath the blanket on the couch,

18
00:02:50,099 --> 00:02:55,000
And felt your hands grip tight into my shirt.

19
00:02:55,699 --> 00:03:00,599
My ribs were burning with a dull, deep ache,

20
00:03:01,199 --> 00:03:06,599
My spirit bruised, but standing still unhurt.

21
00:03:06,800 --> 00:03:11,699
I’m not going anywhere, do you hear?

22
00:03:12,099 --> 00:03:17,000
The lie was born to keep the storm away.

23
00:03:17,500 --> 00:03:22,500
The lion quietly stirs behind my chest,

24
00:03:22,900 --> 00:03:28,500
To guard your shadow till the break of day.

25
00:03:50,500 --> 00:03:55,400
The binary code is shattered on the floor,

26
00:03:55,900 --> 00:04:01,000
The safe and simple world I knew is gone.

27
00:04:01,500 --> 00:04:06,500
Behind the lie that broke my mother's heart,

28
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:13,199
The lion guards till the coming dawn.